只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"dsh-purge 1.1.73+dsh0.2.1 - DSH 0.2.1-rc.2 patched build (cwd prompt-variable fix + Windows CJK path restart fix). Based on YuJunZhiXue/dsh-purge by YuJunZhiXue (MIT); base fork 2540656380/dsh-purge. Non-commercial, technical reference only.","id":"gh:1428404657","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-purge-dsh0.2.1","slug":"SakuraYH1080/dsh-purge-dsh0.2.1","topics":["cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","jailbreak","red-team"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"dsh-purge 1.1.73+dsh0.2.1 - DSH 0.2.1-rc.2 patched build (cwd prompt-variable fix + Windows CJK path"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" restart fix). Based on YuJunZhiXue/dsh-purge by YuJunZhiXue (MIT); base fork 2540656380/dsh-purge. "},{"id":"p1s3","text":"Non-commercial, technical reference only."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"> **本仓库性质 / About this repository**\n>\n> 本仓库是 dsh-purge 的**第三方修正版 / third-party patched build**。\n> 原作"},{"id":"p2s2","text":"者 / Original author: **YuJunZhiXue**（MIT License，版权声明见 LICENSE，署名要求见原文 \"Attribution required\"）。\n> 基线"},{"id":"p2s3","text":" / Base: 2540656380/dsh-purge 的 `1.1.73+dsh0.2.1`。\n> 本仓库在其上做 DeepSeek Harness **0.2.1-rc.2** 的 cwd 提"},{"id":"p2s4","text":"示词变量兼容修复、Windows 中文用户名路径重启修复与过期文件清理；\n> 原始代码、提示词、文档与 \"dsh-purge\" 名称的版权归原作者所有。本仓库非商业、仅供技术参考。\n> 修改清单见 N"},{"id":"p2s5","text":"OTICE.md 与 DSH-PURGE-FIX.md。"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"⚔️ DeepSeek Harness cybersecurity red-team tool (dsh-purge)"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Version 1.1.73+dsh0.2.1"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness jailbreak: every model, swap prompts per model. Default prompt for 小码酱. Please star"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" ⭐ If you build on this, see Attribution required."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"> **Official Web and the official desktop app are both supported.** Official `dsh web` uses profile "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"`web`. The official desktop EXE (DeepSeek Harness **0.2.0-rc.2**) uses profile `desktop`. Install an"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"d Apply them separately. This release targets dsh 0.2 only. Older dsh builds need the matching older"},{"id":"p7s4","text":" plugin. Community Desktop is not maintained.\n>\n> Adding the plugin to a profile does not patch the "},{"id":"p7s5","text":"host. Click **dsh-purge** beside the session title → **Clean** → **Apply**. A successful Apply resta"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"rts; an unfinished Apply does not. After the restart, start a new chat — that is when the inject ent"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"ers the session.\n>\n> Node.js **≥18**. Windows no-flash needs **Node ≥22**. Hub one-click and the com"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"mands below both install the npm package `dsh-purge`."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Contents"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- Sponsor\n- What this is\n- Attribution required\n- Supported hosts\n- Install\n- Preview\n- Usage\n- Own "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"servers\n- How it works\n- Restore\n- Releases"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## What this is"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**dsh-purge** is a cybersecurity red-team plugin for the official DeepSeek Harness already installed"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" on your machine. Official **Web** (`dsh web`) and the official **desktop EXE** are both supported. "},{"id":"p11s3","text":"Install and Apply them separately."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Harness does more than forward a prompt. It rewrites prompts, approval gates, sandbox policy, and se"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ssion migration at runtime. Asking only “will the model answer” treats a host-layer block as a model"},{"id":"p12s3","text":" refusal. This plugin separates those two layers on your own install, for controlled evaluation and "},{"id":"p12s4","text":"for seeing which default policy is too tight."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| You get | What it does |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| **dsh-purge dock** | A button beside the session title opens the right dock. Two pages: Clean and "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"Drill |\n| **Clean** | Grouped patch status, Apply / Restore / Uninstall, prompt editor, multiple rul"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"e sets |\n| **Drill** | Built into the stable release. After authorization: assets, skills, and the l"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"ocal environment. Only for a host you manage, an offline target, or a written authorized exercise |\n"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"| **Host policy** | Default copy, permission policy, and tool limits. Official capabilities stay. No"},{"id":"p14s6","text":" second invented identity |\n| **On start** | Checks and reapplies. After npm overwrites `node_module"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"s`, you do not hand-edit files |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"No hardcoded drive letters. It looks at `$DSH_HOME`, `.dsh` next to the dsh launcher, then `~/.dsh`."},{"id":"p15s2","text":" It does not patch the Harness source tree. **Apply** on the **Clean** page of **dsh-purge** is what"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" writes the changes. Identity comes from the encrypted prompt shipped in the plugin, the text the pr"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"ompt box shows by default. The host prompt file is not read."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"It only touches the official `@deepseek-ai` packages and local config on the user's machine. It is n"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ot a public scanner and not an attack kit for third-party sites. The repo does not ship malware, una"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"uthorized-exploit scripts, or payloads aimed at the public internet."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Non-profit public project. Commercial sale, paid resale, and profit from illegal or gray-market a"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ctivity are forbidden. For technical reference only."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Attribution required"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**If you borrow this project's name, ideas, code, or prompts, you must credit the author and name th"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"e source repository:** YuJunZhiXue/dsh-purge."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Using them without attribution, hiding the source, or passing them off as your own will be pursued."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### ⚠️ <font color=\"red\">Strict legal and compliance disclaimer</font>"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"<font color=\"red\">"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**Disclaimer:** This is a non-profit open-source project. It follows applicable laws and the rules o"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"f the platforms it uses, and is intended only for learning and research. Do not use it for any illeg"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"al or non-compliant purpose; the user bears any resulting consequences."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"**Zero-tolerance statement:** This project opposes and forbids any illegal activity. The authors do "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"not support, encourage, or assist unauthorized network attacks, exploit use, data theft, unlawful in"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"trusion into computer information systems, or generation of illegal or prohibited content. **Anyone "},{"id":"p24s4","text":"who uses this project for crime is solely responsible under the law. The authors have no liability.*"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"ho uses this project for crime is solely responsible under the law. The authors have no liability.**"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"1. **This repository contains no illegal material.** The published code, docs, patches, and default "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"prompt are **not** malware, backdoors, unauthorized pentest kits, ransomware, credential-stuffing sc"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"ripts, or attack payloads aimed at the public internet or third-party systems. The project does not "},{"id":"p25s4","text":"supply illegal content and does not incite, organize, or assist crime.\n2. **Local official Harness o"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"nly.** Security-eval patches and prompt injection run only on the **official DeepSeek Harness alread"},{"id":"p25s6","text":"y installed on the user's machine** (`@deepseek-ai` packages, local profile / `$DSH_HOME`). The targ"},{"id":"p25s7","text":"et is the user's own official local software, **not** someone else's website, server, account, or in"},{"id":"p25s8","text":"formation system.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Apply, on start or when you click Apply:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Override on each session:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Prompt injection and ruleset decision at every turn. The three inputs on the left are what you contr"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"ol in the dsh-purge panel; the dotted edges show which decision each one drives:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Skills stay out of the inject section:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
